":"Christ Jesus then took the form of a servant, in the appearance of a man.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"PHP","chapter":2,"verse":7,"endVerse":null,"scope":"PHP.2.7","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:PHP:2:8:onkd","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_PHP.tsv","sourceLine":23,"originalId":"onkd","originalReference":"2:8"},"book":"PHP","reference":"2:8","question":"How did Jesus humble himself?","answer":"Jesus humbled himself by obeying to the point of death on the cross.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"PHP","chapter":2,"verse":8,"endVerse":null,"scope":"PHP.2.8","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:PHP:2:9:qzz9","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_PHP.tsv","sourceLine":24,"originalId":"qzz9","originalReference":"2:9"},"book":"PHP","reference":"2:9","question":"What did God then do for Jesus?","answer":"God highly exalted Jesus and gave him the name above every name.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"PHP","chapter":2,"verse":9,"endVerse":null,"scope":"PHP.2.9","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:PHP:2:11:r2q5","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_PHP.tsv","sourceLine":25,"originalId":"r2q5","originalReference":"2:11"},"book":"PHP","reference":"2:11","question":"What will every tongue confess?","answer":"Every tongue will confess that Jesus Christ is Lord.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptu